        "body": "Ericsson LM Telephone Co. is a public company headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden, trading under the ticker ERIC. It also appears as Ericsson (LM) Tel-SP ADR. The company describes itself as enabling the full value of connectivity, powering networks that connect billions, and working from 5G to AI-driven automation to help providers and enterprises unlock what connectivity can do.\n\nOn its website, Ericsson discusses 5G, AI, cloud, and 6G, including network slicing, orchestration, and AI-driven tools. It describes building trusted AI for networks and explores how AI moving into the physical world could redefine the role of communications service providers. The site also highlights AT&T's Open Radio Access Network transformation as a foundation for an open, disaggregated, and programmable network.\n\nThe available record lists no lawsuits, no tracked products, and no MCP servers for the company. Its SEC CIK is 0000717826.",
